#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:130
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0"
msgid ""
"The claimant says they are the object; this seat asks where it wants to go "
"before who brought a receipt."
msgstr "申請人は物件本人。本席は領収書より先に行先を尋ねることに賛成。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:131
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.2"
msgid "The statement “{value0}” is in evidence and may not be reduced to “a bit old”."
msgstr "物件の陳述「{value0}」は聴聞記録へ入り、「少し古い」に縮約しない。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:135
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.3"
msgid ""
"Name, wear, and claimant account offer at least two comparisons; use still "
"cannot be decided for the object."
msgstr "名称・摩耗・申請人陳述のうち二点以上が比較可能。ただし用途を物件に代わって決めない。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:136
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.4"
msgid "This evidence resembles a price tag: confident, but silent on wear, time, and witness."
msgstr "この証拠は値札のように自信満々だが、摩耗・時刻・目撃者を示さない。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:139
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.5"
msgid ""
"This file crosses {value0} jurisdictions. The earliest record is not the "
"neatest form; corrections remain side by side."
msgstr "本件は{value0}種の管轄に跨る。最古記録と最も整った書式は同一でない。訂正は併記保存。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:143
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.6"
msgid ""
"A conditional interim ruling is possible. Return does not erase the object's "
"appeal; autonomy does not erase former custodial responsibility."
msgstr "条件付暫定裁定は可能。返還は物件の不服申立を消さず、自主行先も前保管者の責任を免除しない。"

#. propertyOpinions.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:144
msgctxt "text:propertyOpinions.0.7"
msgid ""
"The claimant wants an outcome without conditions; one collection may not "
"erase duties of care, use, and repeat loss."
msgstr "申請人は結果を求め条件を拒否。本席は一度の受取で保守・使用・再紛失責任を消すことを認めない。"

#. propertyClaimSummary.disposition.0
#: src/js/property-model.js:202
msgctxt "text:propertyClaimSummary.disposition.0"
msgid "In hearing"
msgstr "聴聞中"

#. propertyCommunityPosts.0.author
#: src/js/property-model.js:183
msgctxt "text:propertyCommunityPosts.0.author"
msgid "Tsukumogami Property Tribunal · gallery"
msgstr "付喪神物権仲裁所・傍聴席"

#. propertyCommunityPosts.0.body
#: src/js/property-model.js:189
msgctxt "text:propertyCommunityPosts.0.body"
msgid "{value0} reached an outcome; the object's appeal and Akyuu's correction slip remain."
msgstr "{value0} は結論を出したが、物件の不服申立権と阿求の訂正紙は残った。"
